#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-audit-report.md:1
#: da33d937762d4cd7b7cf31555c9e44f9
msgid "导出报告与当前限制"
msgstr "Export reports and current limitations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:10190
#: 8a095346767d4860b42483daba11f549
msgid "导出 HTML 报告"
msgstr "Export an HTML report"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:10192
#: a9acb4646f794bbb8726be36310d7dd4
msgid ""
"点击页面顶部「导出 HTML 报告」，可保存本次数据快照。报告采用与页面相同的阅读"
"优先级，不再把所有原始表格一次性铺开："
msgstr "Click “Export HTML report” at the top of the page to save the current data snapshot. The report follows the same reading priority as the page instead of spreading every raw table across the first screen:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:10194
#: 93d9dd0bd0134a85a095c81b18d1e6be
msgid "第一屏先给出「训练前必须处理」「建议复核」或「未发现阻塞项」；"
msgstr "The first screen reports “Must fix before training”, “Review recommended”, or “No blockers found”;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:10195
#: ded04d1288ea40418163145f5a04ad27
msgid "紧接着显示结构数、精确组分点、阻塞项数、复核组数以及相／磁分析进度；"
msgstr "it then shows the structure count, exact composition points, blocker count, review-group count, and phase/magnetism analysis progress;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:10196
#: 2f8708391b82473ca4421ef539500260
msgid "「Start here」只列最多 3 个最高优先级问题，并给出下一步动作；"
msgstr "`Start here` lists at most three highest-priority issues and gives the next action for each;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:10197
#: f810c625c1084ea2a1375c79be739f3e
msgid ""
"完整复核项按「必须处理」「建议复核」「支持证据」「不可用检查」分组；只有阻塞"
"项默认展开；"
msgstr ""
"The complete review list is grouped into `Must fix`, `Review recommended`, "
"`Supporting evidence`, and `Unavailable checks`; only blockers are expanded by "
"default;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:10198
#: 8769d4102335477e829c2245d9b7283c
msgid ""
"普通复核详情、组分清单、相／磁地图、输入参数和运行指纹默认折叠，需要追证据时"
"再展开。"
msgstr ""
"Routine review details, composition lists, phase/magnetism maps, input parameters, "
"and run fingerprints are collapsed by default and can be expanded when evidence "
"needs to be traced."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:10200
#: c2b9291efa3243f5ac910cf9f970a1f7
msgid ""
"因此，收到报告的人应先读状态横幅和 `Start here`，再展开与自己判断有关的证据。"
"报告中仍保留："
msgstr ""
"A report recipient should therefore read the status banner and `Start here` first, "
"then expand the evidence relevant to the decision at hand. The report still "
"retains:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:10202
#: 71e7b6a2cb8f40cda9a9ab4eb1f16141
msgid "评估范围、生成时间、数据与模型指纹；"
msgstr "The audit scope, generation time, and data and model fingerprints;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:10203
#: 0b0852e0cf17495ea6531fa36e43d99c
msgid "数据质量、组分、标签、局域环境、结构相和磁类型摘要；"
msgstr "Summaries of data quality, composition, labels, local environments, structural phases, and magnetic types;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:10204
#: 47595231eeed491996895979385e752a
msgid "复核项对应的真实结构索引；"
msgstr "The actual structure indices associated with each review item;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:10205
#: 09892adeee344ab7a493118b64bcac1a
msgid "每项判据和能力边界。"
msgstr "The criterion and capability boundary for each item."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:10207
#: bc8e38944e0c4379b8e735d64f3c6cb6
msgid "报告用于记录和协作，不是全局覆盖证明，也不是自动采样指令。"
msgstr "The report supports record-keeping and collaboration; it is neither proof of global coverage nor an automatic sampling instruction."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:10209
#: 42261c435e744771bb4a114d98a49765
msgid "当前不能单独回答什么"
msgstr "Questions the audit cannot answer on its own"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:10211
#: f008e51584b44628b7090eb74e7e2283
msgid "训练集评估不能单独回答："
msgstr "Training Set Audit cannot determine on its own:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:10213
#: 7d7bd74b00f545888a2a0728a6ec5acb
msgid "数据是否覆盖某个温度、压力、缺陷、界面或相变目标；"
msgstr "Whether the data cover a particular temperature, pressure, defect, interface, or phase-transition target;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:10214
#: 7e4cea06b33149f1a69c35195ef4638e
msgid "哪种目标结构一定缺失；"
msgstr "Which target structures are definitively missing;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:10215
#: 8837642b4e164adea6ff7f72deb4b06d
msgid "势函数在独立测试集上的误差；"
msgstr "The potential's error on an independent test set;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:10216
#: bbc59ac016f04beeb8a57bcbd1be6da4
msgid "长时间分子动力学是否稳定；"
msgstr "Whether long-timescale molecular dynamics are stable;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:10217
#: 29d5cdc4dc4c432d88caa7334963a6a0
msgid "某项物性的误差是否可接受；"
msgstr "Whether the error in a particular property is acceptable;"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:10218
#: 679d010021d54273b38c4bdecb38f7ec
msgid "单帧结构和自旋标签对应的热力学相是否稳定。"
msgstr "Whether the thermodynamic phase represented by a single-frame structure and spin label is stable."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/training-set-assessment-content.md:10220
#: 4ce61c4dc9c641579a82977e43f9be52
msgid ""
"这些问题分别需要明确的目标空间、目标结构或轨迹、模型预测、独立参考数据和物性"
"验证协议。「当前数据中少」只表示相对稀少，不等于研究目标中缺失。"
msgstr ""
"These questions require an explicit target space, target structures or trajectories, "
"model predictions, independent reference data, and property-validation protocols. "
"`Rare in the current data` means only relatively scarce; it does not mean absent "
"from the research target."
